                        <field name="dc_title">The Hon. Mr. Pedro Cevallos, first Secretary of State, and interim of Grace and Justice, has informed the... Duke of Infantado, President of the Council, dated 18 of this month, of order of S. M., the following: The King our Lord has solved that in all the Cathedrals and other Churches of the Kingdom are made rogatives by the happy viage of the Serenísimas Ladies Infantas of Portugal, and that during his sailing the praying pro navigantibus... [Printed text] </field>
